{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-mcp-manager-plus#card-zh","repo":"appthin/dsh-mcp-manager-plus","commit":"9a29d1a7fb76ccf32b8c987f9833f244b285cb0e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager-plus 是面向 DSH 网页端的 MCP 服务器管理插件，会在设置侧栏注册「MCP 管理」页面，并由宿主端 API 读取当前 profile 的补丁配置。它展示服务器启用状态、连接阶段和已注册工具，可通过表单或 JSON 添加、编辑服务器，也能导入常见客户端配置。用户还可以启停、删除或就地重启服务器；保存写入 profile 补丁文件，随后页面短暂轮询实际状态。适合希望从网页设置界面维护 MCP 配置、查看连接和工具信息的 DSH 用户。配置使用本机 profile 文件，不需要额外账号或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1582-1596","lib/index.js:433-455","lib/index.js:1031-1068","lib/index.js:620-627"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-mcp-manager-plus#card-en","repo":"appthin/dsh-mcp-manager-plus","commit":"9a29d1a7fb76ccf32b8c987f9833f244b285cb0e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mcp-manager-plus is a DSH web plugin for managing MCP servers. It lists server status and tools, supports form/JSON edits and common config imports, and can enable, disable, delete, or restart servers. Changes persist in the profile patch file; no account or API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1582-1596","lib/index.js:433-455","lib/index.js:1031-1068","lib/index.js:620-627"]}
