{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-mcp-manager-plus#feature-inventory","repo":"appthin/dsh-mcp-manager-plus","commit":"9a29d1a7fb76ccf32b8c987f9833f244b285cb0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager-plus 的功能「服务器清单与状态」：设置页列出 profile 中的 MCP 服务器、启用状态、连接阶段以及模型当前可见的工具名称和描述。打开页面或刷新时重新读取清单。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:425-455","lib/index.js:1031-1039"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-mcp-manager-plus#feature-edit","repo":"appthin/dsh-mcp-manager-plus","commit":"9a29d1a7fb76ccf32b8c987f9833f244b285cb0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager-plus 的功能「添加与编辑配置」：用户可通过表单或 JSON 编辑服务器名称、传输方式、命令、参数、环境变量、工作目录、URL 和请求头；编辑时保留现有行标识。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:636-688","lib/client.js:1524-1529"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-mcp-manager-plus#feature-toggle","repo":"appthin/dsh-mcp-manager-plus","commit":"9a29d1a7fb76ccf32b8c987f9833f244b285cb0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager-plus 的功能「启用与停用」：用户切换服务器开关后，插件把 disabled 覆盖写入 profile 补丁层；已插入的行与 bundle 提供的行采用不同覆盖方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:691-725"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-mcp-manager-plus#feature-restart","repo":"appthin/dsh-mcp-manager-plus","commit":"9a29d1a7fb76ccf32b8c987f9833f244b285cb0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager-plus 的功能「就地重启」：用户可重启已启用且已挂载的 MCP 服务，插件重新初始化对应 loader entry，让连接恢复而不改动服务器配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:777-817"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-mcp-manager-plus#feature-remove","repo":"appthin/dsh-mcp-manager-plus","commit":"9a29d1a7fb76ccf32b8c987f9833f244b285cb0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager-plus 的功能「删除受管服务器」：用户删除自己添加的服务器时，插件移除对应插入行及指向该行的覆盖项，并保留同一补丁块中的其他行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:729-753"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-mcp-manager-plus#feature-import","repo":"appthin/dsh-mcp-manager-plus","commit":"9a29d1a7fb76ccf32b8c987f9833f244b285cb0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-manager-plus 的功能「跨格式导入」：用户粘贴 MCP 配置后，插件识别并规范化多个客户端的配置字段，逐条新增或更新服务器，并汇报未处理的条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/import.js:205-225","lib/import.js:352-384","lib/index.js:835-889"]}
